  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il broie les Baies à grands coups de\ncrocs. Ceux-ci repoussent plusieurs\nfois, toujours plus forts et aiguisés.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They use their tusks to crush the\nberries they eat. Repeated regrowth\nmakes their tusks strong and sharp.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il laisse la marque de ses crocs dans les\narbres pour marquer son territoire. Ses\ncrocs repoussent dès qu’ils tombent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They mark their territory by leaving\ngashes in trees with their tusks. If a\ntusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its large tusks have a tendency to\nbreak, but each time they grow back,\nthey grow in harder and sturdier.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its large tusks have a tendency to\nbreak, but each time they grow back,\nthey grow in harder and sturdier.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きのみを　キバで　くだいて　たべる。\nなんかいも　はえかわることで\nつよく　するどい　キバに　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "나무열매를 이빨로 깨물어 먹는다.\n이빨이 몇 차례에 걸쳐 새로 나면\n강하고 날카로워진다",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il broie les Baies à grands coups de crocs.\nCeux-ci repoussent plusieurs fois, toujours plus forts\net aiguisés.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es knackt mit seinen Hauern Nüsse.\nBrechen seine Fangzähne ab, wächst\nan ihrer Stelle ein stärkeres Ersatzpaar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa sus colmillos para romper las bayas que come.\nEstos se regeneran una y otra vez, por eso son tan\nfuertes y afilados.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mangia le bacche sminuzzandole con i denti, che\nricrescono costantemente, diventando sempre più\nforti e affilati.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They use their tusks to crush the berries they eat.\nRepeated regrowth makes their tusks strong\nand sharp.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "木の実を　キバで　砕いて　食べる。\n何回も　生え変わることで\n強く　鋭い　キバに　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa sus colmillos para romper las bayas que come.\nEstos se regeneran una y otra vez, por eso son tan\nfuertes y afilados.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "キバで　じゅもくに　きずを　つけて\nなわばりの　めじるしにする。\nキバは　おれても　すぐに　はえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "이빨로 수목에 상처를 내서\n영역 표시를 한다.\n부러지면 바로 새 이빨이 난다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il laisse la marque de ses crocs dans les arbres pour\nmarquer son territoire. Ses crocs repoussent dès\nqu’ils tombent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Markiert sein Revier, indem es mit seinen Fängen\nKerben in Bäume schlägt. Brechen diese einmal ab,\nwachsen sie sofort nach.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Deja la huella de sus colmillos en los árboles para\nmarcar su territorio. Si se le rompen, se regeneran\nmuy rápido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Incide gli alberi con le zanne per marcare il suo\nterritorio. Se le zanne gli si spezzano, ricrescono\nsubito.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees\nwith their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows\nin quickly.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
